  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Migration Response in Romania, Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to continue supporting the migration response in Romania, through: provision of information to conflict-affected population living in Romania and support their inclusion into host communities across Romania, as well as data collection and analysis of people on the move fleeing Ukraine. It also proposes to strengthen the capacity of the Municipality of Bucharest to provide and/or facilitate access to basic services for migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
